#: backtrace.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Could not generate a backtrace as the debugger '%1' was not found."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस तैआर नहि कए पएलक किएक' डिबगर '%1'  नहि भेटल."

#: debugger.cpp:71
msgid "C&opy"
msgstr "नकल (&o)"

#: debugger.cpp:83
#, c-format
msgid "Application: %progname (%execname), signal %signame"
msgstr "अनुप्रयोग: %progname (%execname), सिगनल %signame"

#: debugger.cpp:96
msgctxt "debugging finished"
msgid "Backtrace loaded."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस लोड भए गेल."

#: debugger.cpp:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Backtrace saved to <filename>%1</filename>."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस <filename>%1</filename> पर सहेजल गेल."

#: debugger.cpp:125
msgid "Cannot create a file to save the backtrace in"
msgstr "एकरामे बैकट्रैस केँ सहेजबा क' लेल फाइल नहि बनाए सकल"

#: debugger.cpp:133
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "फाइल नाम चुनू"

#: debugger.cpp:141
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A file named <filename>%1</filename> already exists. Are you sure you want "
"to overwrite it?"
msgstr ""
"फाइल नाम <filename>%1</filename> पहिने सँ अस्तित्व मे अछि. की अहाँ एकरे उप्पर मेटा कए "
"लिखब चाहब?"

#: debugger.cpp:143
msgid "Overwrite File?"
msgstr "फाइल केर उप्पर लिखू?"

#: debugger.cpp:144
msgid "&Overwrite"
msgstr "मेटाकए लिखू (&O)"

#: debugger.cpp:156
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot open file <filename>%1</filename> for writing."
msgstr "फाइल <filename>%1</filename> केँ लिखबाक लेल खोलल नहि जाए सकल."

#: debugger.cpp:164 debugger.cpp:169
msgid "Unable to create a valid backtrace."
msgstr "एकटा वैध बैकट्रेस बनाबै मे अक्षम."

#: debugger.cpp:165 debugger.cpp:170
msgid ""
"This backtrace appears to be of no use.\n"
"This is probably because your packages are built in a way which prevents "
"creation of proper backtraces, or the stack frame was seriously corrupted in "
"the crash.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"प्रतीत हाएत अछि जे ई बैकट्रेस कोनो काम कए नहि अछि.\n"
"एहिना साइत एहि लेल अछि जे अथवा तँ अहाँक पैकेज एहि तरह सँ बनल अछि जे उचित बैकट्रेसेस क' "
"बनबासँ रोकैत अछि अथवा फिनु क्रैश मे फ्रेम गंभीर रूपेँ खराब भए गेल अछि.\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:179
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस लोड कएल जाए रहल अछि..."

#: debugger.cpp:202
msgid ""
"The following options are enabled:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"निम्न विकल्प सक्षम अछि:\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:204
msgid ""
"\n"
"As the usage of these options is not recommended - because they can, in rare "
"cases, be responsible for KDE problems - a backtrace will not be generated.\n"
"You need to turn these options off and reproduce the problem again in order "
"to get a backtrace.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"जहिना जे ई विकल्पसभ क' उपयोग अनुशंसित नहि अछि - किएक' ओ कहियो केडीई समस्यासभ क' लेल "
"उत्तरदायी होइछ - बैकट्रेस नहि बनत.\n"
"बैकट्रेस पाबै क' लेल अहाँक ई विकल्पसभ केँ बन्न कएनाइ पड़त आओर ओ समस्या केँ फिनु उत्पन्न करै "
"पड़त.\n"

#: debugger.cpp:209
msgid "Backtrace will not be created."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस तैआर नहि कएल जाए सकल."

#: debugger.cpp:220
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "संकेत लोड कएल जाए रहल अछि..."

#: debugger.cpp:239
msgid "System configuration startup check disabled.\n"
msgstr "तंत्र बिन्यासक जाँच अक्षम अछि.\n"

#: drbugreport.cpp:53
msgid "You have to edit the description before the report can be sent."
msgstr "बग रिपोर्ट भेजल जाए सकए एकरा लेल अहाँक पहिने वर्णन संपादित कएनाइ हाएत."

#: krashconf.cpp:78
msgctxt "unknown application"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "अज्ञात"

#: krashconf.cpp:159
#, kde-format
msgid "<application>%1</application>"
msgstr "<application>%1</application>"

#: krashconf.cpp:164 krashconf.cpp:171
#, kde-format
msgid "<command>%1</command>"
msgstr "<command>%1</command>"

#: krashconf.cpp:177
#, kde-format
msgid "<filename>%1</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>%1</filename>"

#: main.cpp:43
msgid "KDE crash handler gives the user feedback if a program crashed"
msgstr "केडीई क्रेश हैंडलर प्रयोक्ता केँ फीडबैक देत अछि जँ कोनो प्रोग्राम क्रैश होइछ"

#: main.cpp:59
msgid "The KDE Crash Handler"
msgstr "केडीई क्रेश हैंडलर"

#: main.cpp:63
msgid "(C) 2000-2003, Hans Petter Bieker"
msgstr "(C) 2000-2003, हैंस पीटर बीइकर"

#: main.cpp:64
msgid "Hans Petter Bieker"
msgstr "हैंस पीटर बीइकर"

#: main.cpp:70
msgid "The signal number that was caught"
msgstr "संकेतक क्रमांक जे पकड़ल गेल."

#: main.cpp:71
msgid "Name of the program"
msgstr "प्रोग्राम क' नाम"

#: main.cpp:72
msgid "Path to the executable"
msgstr "एक्जीक्यूटेबल क' पथ"

#: main.cpp:73
msgid "The version of the program"
msgstr "प्रोग्राम क' संस्करण"

#: main.cpp:74
msgid "The bug address to use"
msgstr "उपयोग क' लेल बग पता."

#: main.cpp:75
msgid "Translated name of the program"
msgstr "अनूदित प्रोग्राम क' नाम"

#: main.cpp:76
msgid "The PID of the program"
msgstr "प्रोग्राम क' पीआईडी"

#: main.cpp:77
msgid "Startup ID of the program"
msgstr "प्रोग्राम क' आरंभक आईडी"

#: main.cpp:78
msgid "The program was started by kdeinit"
msgstr "प्रोग्राम केडीईइनिट द्वारा प्रारंभ कएल गेल"

#: main.cpp:79
msgid "Disable arbitrary disk access"
msgstr "मनमाना डिस्क एक्सेस अक्षम करू"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "संगीता कुमारी"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "sangeeta09@gmail.com"

#: toplevel.cpp:54
msgid "&Bug Report"
msgstr "बग रिपोट करू (&B)"

#: toplevel.cpp:55
msgid "&Debugger"
msgstr "डिबगर (&D)"

#: toplevel.cpp:88
msgid "Show details"
msgstr "विवरण देखाबू"

#: toplevel.cpp:93
msgid ""
"Please include the following information in your bug report, after your "
"description of the steps to reproduce the crash."
msgstr ""

#: toplevel.cpp:135
msgid "A Fatal Error Occurred"
msgstr "एकटा गंभीर त्रुटि भेल"

#: toplevel.cpp:143
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>Application crashed</b></p><p>The "
"program %appname crashed.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p style=\"margin-bottom: 6px;\"><b>अनुप्रयोग क्रैश भए गेल</b></p><p>प्रोग्राम %"
"appname क्रैश भए गेल.</p>"

#: toplevel.cpp:162
msgid ""
"<p>Do you want to generate a backtrace? This will help the developers to "
"figure out what went wrong.</p>\n"
"<p>Unfortunately this will take some time on slow machines.</p><p><b>Note: A "
"backtrace is not a substitute for a proper description of the bug and "
"information on how to reproduce it. It is not possible to fix the bug "
"without a proper description.</b></p>"
msgstr ""

#: toplevel.cpp:174
msgid "Include Backtrace"
msgstr "बैकट्रेस जोडू"

#: toplevel.cpp:174
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "बनाबू (&G)"

#: toplevel.cpp:174
msgid "Do Not Generate"
msgstr "बनाबू नहि"

#: toplevel.cpp:241
msgid "It was not possible to generate a backtrace."
msgstr "बैकट्रेस तैआर कएनाइ संभव नहि"

#: toplevel.cpp:242
msgid "Backtrace Not Possible"
msgstr "बैकट्रेस संभव नहि"

